  {
    "id": "c002",
    "name": "Five-Year RX License Package",
    "text": "ARP Wave 5 Year RX 100 License $15000.00 With special discount per Denis $10,000.00 Includes 1 hour per month of our time at $300.00 per hour for 60 months. (You calling us ) Includes Loosening and Recovery Protocols Includes Protocols as needed for personal injury, or rehab."
  },
  {
    "id": "c003",
    "name": "Five-Year RX License Consulting Option",
    "text": "Licensee Options For 5 Year RX License ARP Wave Yearly Consulting Plan $5200.00 Includes us calling you weekly fora minimum of 20 minutes a week to set up your plan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c004",
    "name": "Resale Restriction",
    "text": "ITIS AFDA VIOLATION TO RESELL. THIS IS A LICENSE TO USE. THE ARP IS THE PROPERTY OF ARP WAVE LLC AND CAN NOT BE RESOLD."
  },
  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "ARP Wave Equipment Lease Grant",
    "text": "ARP WAVE EQUIPMENT LEASE ARP WAVE, LLC, a Minnesota Limited Liability Company (\"hereinafter called Lessor\") whose address is 7721 145\" West, Apple Valley MN 55124, hereby leases to ARP Wave Austin, Garrett Salpeter , whose address is_3001 Bee Caves Rd Ste 210 Austin, TX 78746 (hereinafter called “Lessee”) and Lessee hereby hires and leases from Lessor, the equipment, machinery and appurtenances described above, referred to herein as “equipment,” upon the following terms and conditions."
  },
  {
    "id": "c006",
    "name": "1. Term",
    "text": "Term. The term of this Lease with respects to the equipment leased hereunder shall begin with the first day of the month following the date of shipment and shall continue in full force and effect for the period of months indicated in Block A on Page 1, said period hereinafter referred to as the \"origmal term.\" Lessee shail have the option to renew this lease on an annual basis, after the expiration of the initial term, by providing notice and paying the required fees charged by the Lessor related to the renewal."
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "2. Rent",
    "text": "Rent. Lessee shall pay to Lessor as rental for the equipment leased hereunder, the sum shown in Block B above during the original term, sald rental to be paid in advance or before the first day of each month during the original term, to Lessor at its above designated office or at such other place and/or to such other person as Lessor may from time to time designate in writing."
  },
  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "3. Selection of Equipment and Inspection",
    "text": "Selection of Equipment and Inspection, Lessee has requested equipment of the type and quantity specified above. Lessee and Lessor agree that this Lease is a \"True Lease” as defined by the Uniform Commercial Code Article 2A. Lessor shail not be liable for specific performance of this Lease or for damages if for any reason the supplier delays or fails to fill the order for the equipment. Lessee shall accept such equipment if delivered in good repair, and hereby authorizes Lessor to add to this Lease the serial number of each item of equipment so delivered. Any delay in such delivery shall not affect the validity of this Lease. The Lessee shall inspect the equipment within forty-eight (48) hours after receipt thereof Unless the Lessee within said period of time gives written notice to the Lessor specifying any defect in or other proper objection to the equipment, the Lessee agrees that it shall be conclusively presumed as between Lessor and Lessee, that Lessee has fully inspected, has acknowledged that the equipment is in good condition and repair and that the Lessce has found the equipment acceptable to it under the terms of the Lease. Unless the Lessor receives notice as provided by this paragraph, the term of this Lease shall begin and payment shall be due to Lessor as provided by Paragraph 1 of this Lease."
  },
  {
    "id": "c009",
    "name": "4. Repair Warranty",
    "text": "Repair Warranty. Lessor shall repair defects to the equipment free of charge during the term of this lease so long as the defect does not atise out of misuse or negligence on the part of Lessee, If the required repair is determined to be the result of misuse or negligence on the part of Lessee, then Lessee shall be responsible for payment of all costs incurred in making the repair. Ifa repair is required, Lessee shall ship the equipment to Lessor’s facility for inspection and repair as may be necessary."
  },
  {
    "id": "c010",
    "name": "5. Disclaimer of Warranty",
    "text": "Disclaimer of Warranty. EXCEPT AS IS SPECIFICALLY PROVIDED HEREIN, LESSOR MAKES NO EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTY AS TO ANY MATTER WHATSOEVER, INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, THE DESIGN OR CONDITION OF EQUIPMENT, ITS MERCHANTABILITY OR JTS FITNESS FOR ANY PARTICULAR PURPOSE, THE QUALITY OF MATERIAL OR WORKMANSHIP OF THE EQUIPMENT OR ITS CONFORMITY WITH ANY SPECIFICATIONS OR ORDER; NO DEFECT OR UNFITNESS OF THE EQUIPMENT SHALL RELIEVE LESSER OF THE OBLIGATION UNDER THIS LEASE."
  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "6. Liability of Lessor",
    "text": "Liability of Lessor. RECEIVED 85/25/2816 10:44 May 25 10 10:38a p.3 10, 11, LESSOR AND THE PARTY FROM WHOM LESSOR OBTAINS THE EQUIPMENT IN THE EVENT TBE EQUIPMENT IS NOT OWNED BY LESSOR, SHALL NOT BE LIABLE TO LESSEE, OR TO ANY OTHER PERSON, FIRM, OR CORPORATION, FOR ANY LOSS OR INTERRUPTION OF OR DAMAGE TO BUSINESS, OR PROFITS, OR FOR ANY OTHER DAMAGIS OF ANY KIND OR NATURE WHATSOEVER, DIRECT OR CONSEQUENTIAL, RESULTING FROM THE DELAY OR FAILURE TO FURNISH EQUIPMENT HEREUNDER, OR THE FAILURE OF THE EQUIPMENT TO OPERATE OR FAULTY OPERATION OF THE EQUIPMENT OR SYSTEM, OR IN ANY MANNER RESULTING FROM THE INSTALLATION, OPERATION, SERVICE OR USE OF THE EQUIPMENT LEASED HEREUNDER. THE LESSOR'S LIABILITY TO THE LESSEE, IF ANY, SHALL IN NO EVENT EXCEED THE TOTAL AMOUNT OF RENT PAID BY THE LESSEE TO THE LESSOR UNDER THE LEASE AT THE TIME THE CLAIM IS MADE."
  },
  {
    "id": "c012",
    "name": "7. Ownership and Alterations of Equipment",
    "text": "Ownership and Alterations of Equipment, The equipment shall at ail tires be and remain, the sole and exclusive property of the Lessor and the Lessee shall have no right, title or interest therein or thereto except as expressly set forth in this Lease. Without the prior written consent of the Lessor, the Lessee shall not make any alterations, changes, additions or improvements to the equipment. All additions and improvements of whatsoever kind or nature made to the equipment shall belong to and become the property of Lessor upon the expiration or earlier termination of this lease,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c013",
    "name": "8. Loss and Damage; Maintenance",
    "text": "Loss and Damage; Maintenance There shall be no modification of the ARP Unit. The Lessee hereby assumes and shall bear the entire risk of loss and damage to the equipment from any and every cause whatsoever. No loss or damage to the equipment or any part thereof shall impair any obligation of the Lessee under this Lease which shall continue in full force and effect, including but not limited to the obligations of the Lessee to make rental payments. If the equipment is determined by Lessor, in its sole discretion, to be repairable, Lessee shall be liable to repair the equipment at its expense and to continue making rental payments as provided by this Lease. Lessee shall keep the ARP Unit in good repair and any repair necessitated from Lesee’s lack of maintenance, misuse or negligence shall be at Lessee’s cost. The Lessee shall keep the equipment insured against all risks of loss or damage from every cause whatsoever for not less than the full replacement value thereof as determined by the Lessor; and shall carry public ability and property damage insurance covering the equipment. All said insurance shall be in form and amount and with companies approved by the Lessor, and shall be in the joint names of the Lessor and the Lessee."
  },
  {
    "id": "c014",
    "name": "9. Lessee's Obligations Cnconditional",
    "text": "Lessee's Obligations Cnconditional. Lessee’s obligations to pay all rent, and all the rights of Lessor in and to such payments, shall be absolute and unconditional and shall not be subject to any abatement, reduction, set-off, defense, counter claim or recoupment for any reason, including without limitation, any such amount due or alleged to be due, to, or by reason of, any past, present or future claims which Lessee may have against Lessor, the manufacturer or any other seller of the equipment, or any other person or entity, for any reason. Except as otherwise expressly provided herein, this Lease shall not terminate nor shall the respective obligations of the Lessor or the Lessee be affected, by reason of defect in or casualty to or obsolescence of the equipment from any cause, or by the interference with the use thereof by any private person, corporation or governmental authority or any other disability of the Lessee to use the equipment, or for any other cause, whether similar or dissimilar to the foregoing, including, but not limited to, war, act of god, governmental regulations, any present or future law or regulation to the contrary not withstanding. It is the express intention of the Lessor and Lessee that all rent payable by the Lessee hereunder shall be, and continued to be, payable in all events unless the obligation to pay the same shall be (erminated pursuant to the express provisions of this Lease."
  },
  {
    "id": "c015",
    "name": "10. Encumbrances, Taxes, and Fees",
    "text": "Encumbrances, Taxes, and Fees. Lessee shall keep the equipment leased hereunder free from all liens, security interests and encumbrances of any nature whatsoever, and shall pay all license fees, registration fees, assessments, charges and taxes which may now or hereafter be imposed by any governmental authority upon the leasing, renting, sale, possession, use or ownership of the equipment, excluding all taxes on or measured by Lessor's income."
  },
  {
    "id": "c016",
    "name": "11. Surrender",
    "text": "Surrender. Upon the expiration or earlier termination of this Lease, with respect to any item of equipment, the Lessee shall return the same to the Lessor in good repair, condition and working order, ordinary wear and tear resulting from proper use thereof alone excepted, in the following manner as may be specified by the Lessor: RECEIVED 65/25/2018 10:44 May 25 10 10:38a p.4 a, By delivering such item of equipment at the Lessee’s cost and expense to such place as the Lessor shall specily within the county in which the same was delivered to the Lessee or to which same was moved with the written consent of the Lessor; or, b. By loading such item of equipment at the Lessee's cost and expense on board such carrier as the Lessor shall specify and shipping the same, freight prepaid, to the destination, within the continental United States, designated by the Lessor."
  },
  {
    "id": "c017",
    "name": "12. Default",
    "text": "12. Default. 13 14, If Lessee shall be in default under any terms or conditions of this Agreement; if Lessee shall be in default or in breach under any term or conditions of the License Agreement or any other agreement executed with ARP WAVE, LLC; if Lessee shall file a voluntary petition in bankruptcy or shall make an assignment for the benefit of creditors or shall be adjudicated a bankrupt; if there is a dissolution, whether voluntary or involuntary, or other termination of the existence of Lessee; if any representation or warranty, or any document or instrument fumished to the Lessee in connection with the transaction proves to be false in any material respect or omits to state any material fact; if any individual guarantor of the Lease should die, become insolvent, or file for protection under any bankruptcy or similar law; or if Lessor deems itself insecure, Lessor shall have the right to exercise any one or more of the following remedies: a. To declare the entire amount of rent hereunder immediately due and payable as to any or all items of equipment, without notice or demand to the Lessee. b. To sue for and recover all rents, and other payments, then accrued or thereafter accruing, with respect to all items of equipment. c. To take possession of any or all items of equipment without demand or notice, wherever the same shall be located, without any court order or other process of law. The Lessee hereby waives any and all damage occasioned by such taking of possession. Any said taking of possession shall not constitute a termination of this Lease as to any or all items of equipment unless the Lessor expressly so notifies the Lessee in writing. d,. To terminate this Lease as to any or all items of equipment, e. To pursue any other remedy at law or in equity. Notwithstanding any said repossession or any other action which the Lessor may take, the Lessee shall be and remain liable for performance of all obligations on its part to be performed ander this Lease. Lessee hereby waives any and all damages occasioned by the exercise by Lessor of any of Lessor’s rights or remedies upon the occurrence of an event of default under this section. Lessee agrees to indemnify Lessor for all costs and expenses, including reasonable attorneys’ fees, incurred by the Lessor in connection with the enforcement by it of any of its rights or remedies under the Lease. Any default under the License Agreement or any other agreement signed contemporancously between Lessor and Lessee shall be deemed a to be a default under this Lease Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c018",
    "name": "13. Indemnity",
    "text": "Indemnity, The Lessee shall indemnify the Lessor against, and hold the Lessor harmless from, any and all claims, actions, suits, proceedings, costs, expenses, damages, and liabilities, including attormey's fees, arising out of, connected with, or resulting from the equipment, including without limiting the generality of the foregoing, the manufacture, selection, delivery, possession, use, operation or return of the equipment."
  },
  {
    "id": "c019",
    "name": "13. Protocol Compliance and Safety",
    "text": "Jt is expressly understood that it is possible by acting outside the scope of use for the equipment to cause harm to the applicator and the applicatee. As such the Licensee shal! follow at all times the Protocols licensed in conjunction with the equipment under the License Agreement and never use the equipment on a person with a pacemaker or in a manner contrary to that prescribed in the manual provided to Lessee with each ARP Unit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c020",
    "name": "14. Assignment",
    "text": "Assignment. Without the prior written consent of the Lessor, the Lessee shall not (a) assign, transfer, pledge or hypothecate this Lease, the equipment or any part thereof, or any interest therein or (b) sublet or lend the equipment or any part thereof, or permit the equipment or any part thereof to be used by anyone other than the Lessee or the Lessee's employees. Consent to any of the foregoing prohibited acts applies only in the given instance, and is not a consent to any subsequent like act by the Lessee or any other person. Subject always to the foregoing, this Lease inures to the benefit of, and is binding upon, the heirs, legatees, personal representatives, successors and assigns of the parties hereto."
  },
  {
    "id": "c021",
    "name": "15. Lessor's Assignment",
    "text": "15, Lessor's Assignment. All rights of the Lessor hereunder may be assigned, pledged, mortgaged, transferred or otherwise disposed of, either in whole or in part, without notice to the Lessee. If the Lessor assigns this Lease or the rentals due or to become due hereunder RECEIVED 65/25/2018 16:44 May 25 10 10:40a p.b or any other interest herein whether as security for any of its indebtedness or otherwise, no breach or default by the Lessor hereunder or pursuant to any other agreement between the Lessor or the Lessee, if any, shall excuse performance by the Lessee of any provision hereof. No such assignee shall be obligated to perform any duty, covenant or condition required. to be performed by the Lessor under the terms of this Lease."
  },
  {
    "id": "c022",
    "name": "16. Interest",
    "text": "16. Interest. Should the Lessee fail to pay any portion of the rent herein reserved or any other sum required by the Lessee to be paid to the Lessor within ten (10) days after the due date hereof, the Lessee shall pay unto the Lessor interest on such. delinquent payment from the expiration of said ten (10) days until paid at the highest rate permitted by the laws of the state whose laws govern this Agreement, but not to exceed 8% per annum."
  },
  {
    "id": "c023",
    "name": "17. Offset",
    "text": "17. Offset. The Lessee hereby waives any and all existing and future claims and offsets against any rent or other payments due hereunder; and agrees to pay the rent and other amounts hereunder regardless of any offset or claims which may be asserted by the Lessee or on its behalf. Lessor is authorized by Lessee to apply or cause to be applied against amounts owing Lessor hereunder any amounts which might from time to time be owed to Lessor or any affiliate of Lessor by Lessee."
  },
  {
    "id": "c024",
    "name": "18. Entire Agreement",
    "text": "18, Entire Agreement, This Lease constitutes the entire agreement between the parties hereto; and this Lease shall not be modified, amended, altered, or changed except by a written agreement signed by the parties hereto,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "19. Multiple Lessees",
    "text": "19. Multiple Lessees. If there is more than one Lessee named in this Lease, the liability of each shall be joint and several."
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "20. Non-Waiver",
    "text": "20. Non-Waiver. Neither the failure of either party to insist upon the performance of any term or condition of this Lease or to exercise any right or privilege conferred by this Lease nor the waiver by either party of any such term or condition shal! be construed as thereafter waiving any such term, condition, right or privilege."
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "21. Construction",
    "text": "21. Construction. This Lease Agreement is made with reference to and shall be governed and construed exclusively by the laws of the State of Minnesota, without reference to its conflicts of laws provisions. Venue for the enforcement of this Agreement shall be limited to the Hennepin County, Minnesota, Federal or State District Court to the exclusion of all other courts, but subject to appeal as provided for under Minnesota law and applicable rules of civil and appellate procedure. Lessee expressly waives any claim that this forum is inconvenient and stipulates to the Courts jurisdiction over its/his/her person."
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "22. Notice",
    "text": "22. Notice. All notices, requests and other communications required or permitted to be given hereunder shall be in writing and shall be deemed to have been duly given if delivered personally, given by prepaid telegram or mailed first class, postage prepaid, registered or certified mail, to the address listed hereon for the Lessor and Lessee, or to such other address es either party shall notify the other, by the means described in this paragraph."
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "23. Severability",
    "text": "23. Severability. Lf any provision of the Lease is held to be unenforceable, the remainder of the Lease shall not be affected thereby but shall remain valid and enforceable. If any provision of this Lease is so broad as to be unenforceable, such provision shall be sufficiently narrowed so as to make it enforceable."
  },
  {
    "id": "c030",
    "name": "License Agreement Parties",
    "text": "ARP WAVE LICENSE AGREEMENT THIS AGREEMENT is made on the date appearing below, by and between ARP WAVE, LLC, a Minnesota Limited Liability Company with its principal place of business at 7721 145\" West, Apple Valley, MN 55124 (hereinafter sometimes referred to as “ARP” or “Licensor”) and (Licensee”)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c031",
    "name": "License Recital—System Ownership",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Licensor is the owner of all right, title and interest in and to the Accelerated Recovery Program Protocols, Ultra Fit Athletic Mastery Protocols and In Balance Muscle Testing Protocols, related programs, and related intellectual property (hereinafter sometimes referred to collectively and/or independently as “System(s)”), and. this property is being licensed to Licensee under the terms and conditions set forth below;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c032",
    "name": "License Recital—Requested License",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Licensee has indicated to Licensor a desire to have a non-exclusive license for the use of said System(s)s set forth in Section 2 below, subject to the terms of this Agreement and to Licensor’s ongoing monitoring, revision, upgrading, customizing, updating and modification as Licensor may deem necessary or appropriate in its sole and absolute discretion;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c033",
    "name": "Section 1. Definition of Syvstem(s)",
    "text": "SECTION 1— DEFINITIONS 1, “Syvstem(s)” shall mean the Licensor’s proprietary training protocols and programs, copyrights, trade marks, service marks, trade secrets and all other intellectual property associated with Accelerated Recovery Program Protocols, Ultra Fit Athletic Mastery Protocols and ARP Muscle Testing Protocols, related programs, and related intellectual property. The System(s), and any and all rights thereto, shail at all times remain the exclusive intellectual and material property of Licensor."
  },
  {
    "id": "c034",
    "name": "Section 2.1 License Grant",
    "text": "SECTION 2 ~ LICENSE Licensor hereby grants and Licensee hereby receives and accepts a non-exclusive license to Licensee for use of the following System(s) solely in accordance with the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement: ARP loosening and recovery ARP Therapy Protocol Limited 60 Minutes a month specialist support"
  },
  {
    "id": "c035",
    "name": "Section 2.2 Nontransferability",
    "text": "2, Licensor and Licensee acknowledge and agree that Licensees rights herein are not transferable and are forfeitable in the event of certain circumstances or occurrences as herein set forth. At no time shall the rights of Licensee herein, or any portion thereof, either voluntarily or involuntarily, be further assigned, transferred, conveyed or otherwise disposed of by Licensee. Any such attempted conveyance or transfer shalt be deemed a material breach of this Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c036",
    "name": "Section 2.3 System Enhancements and Modifications",
    "text": "3. Licensee acknowledges and agrees that without Licensor’s express written consent, Licensee shall not make enhancements or modify, or alter the System(s) or any parts thereof, herein provided and licensed to Licensee, and that, raoreover, regardless if said consent is obtained, any further enhancements of said System(s) or any parts thereof, shall at all times remain the sole and absolutely property of Licensor. Licensee and Licensor agree that from time to time Licensor may make enhancements or otherwise modify or alter the System(s) provided and licensed herein and that all such enhancements shall be the property of Licensor and the use thereof will be governed by this License."
  },
  {
    "id": "c037",
    "name": "Section 2.4 Assignment and Sublicensing",
    "text": "4. Without limitation to anything aforesaid, there shall be no right of assigoment or sublicense provided to Licensee under this Agreement. Licensor, however, shall at any time be entitled to assign this Agreement, in whole or in part, without the prior written consent of Licensee, to such person, entity, trust or other third party as Licensor may in its sole and absolute discretion determine. In the event of such assignment, provided Licensee is afforded notice of such assignment by Licensor, this Licensor shali then have no responsibility or liability or any continued obligations of any nature whatsoever to Licensee herein."
  },
  {
    "id": "c038",
    "name": "Section 3. Maintenance and Support",
    "text": "SECTION 3 ~- MAINTENANCE AND SUPPORT Licensor shall provide the following support to Licensee: Monthly seminars in Minneapolis, Minnesota, Telephone Consultation and email support shall be provided in accordance with Section 5 below."
  },
  {
    "id": "c039",
    "name": "Section 4. Licensee’s Responsibility/Confidentiality",
    "text": "SECTION 4— LICENSEE’S RESPONSIBILITY/CONFIDENTIALITY Without limitation, the trademarks and service marks which are part of the System(s), are owned exclusively by the Licensor. Licensee acknowledges and agrees that the System(s) herein licensed are proprietary to Licensor and constitute trade marks, service marks, copyrights and trade secrets of Licensor, and title thereto is not conveyed to Licensee and that Licensee’s sole right and interest in and to the System(s) is the License herein granted. Licensee shall keep all System(s) licensed hereunder strictly confidential and shall not disclose, display, sell, transfer, publish, or otherwise make available the System(s) to any other party without the written consent of Licensor, The provisions of this paragraph shall not be deemed to derogate or lessen responsibilities set forth in any other provision hereof or available at law,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c040",
    "name": "Section 5.1 Term and Renewal",
    "text": "SECTION 5~ TERM AND TERMINATION I. This Agreement shall become effective on lease/license start date set forth in Block A of Page 1 and shall continue in full force and effect for the number of months indicated in Block A of Page |, unless otherwise terminated pursuant to the terms hereunder. Lessee shall have the option to renew this lease on an annual basis, after the expiration of the initial term, by providing notice and paying the fees requested by the Licensor related to the renewal."
  },
  {
    "id": "c041",
    "name": "Section 5.2 Survival",
    "text": "2, When and in the event this Agreement is terminated, the covenants and provisions herein set forth shall survive such termination, except those covenants as pertaining to future payments to be made by Licensee,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c042",
    "name": "Section 5.3 Automatic Termination or Revocation",
    "text": "3, This license shall be deemed automatically terminated or revoked: (i) in the event of a judgment, levy, lien, attachment, notice of foreclosure, or other adverse creditor action against Licensee pertaining to the possession, ownership or operation of said right to use said System(s); (ii) any Licensee attempt to disclose, display, pledge, sell and transfer the System(s) or sublicense, assign or convey, whether voluntary or involuntary, this license right."
  },
  {
    "id": "c043",
    "name": "Section 6.1 Default and Remedies",
    "text": "SECTION 6— DEFAULT AND CHOICE OF LAW/JURISDICTION 1. If Licensee shall be in default under any conditions of this Agreement or any other agreement entered into between Licensor and Licensee; if Licensee shall file a voluntary petition in bankruptcy or shall make an assignment for the benefit of creditors or shall be adjudicated a bankrupt; if there is a dissolution, whether voluntary or involuntary, or other termination of the existence of Licensee; if any representation or warranty, or any document or instrament furnished to the Licensor in connection with the transaction proves to be false in any material respect or omits to state any material fact; if any individual guarantor of this Agreement should die, become insolvent, or file for protection under any bankruptcy or similar law; or if Licensor deems itself insecure, Licensor shall have the right to exercise any one or more of the following remedies: a. To declare the entire amount owed under this Agreement hereunder immediately due and payable as to any or all Systern(s), without notice or demand to the Licensee. b. Yo sue for and recover all fees, and other payments, then accrued or thereafter accruing, with respect to all System(s). c, To take possession of any or all tangible System(s) without demand or notice, wherever the same shall be located, without any court order or other process of law, The Licensee hereby waives any and all damage occasioned by such taking of possession, Any said taking of possession shall not release Licensee of any obligations under this Agreement. d. To immediately require the Licensee to cease and desist from use of any System(s), trademarks, service marks, copyrights or trade secrets of Licensor. The Licensee hereby agrees that upon such demand being given by Licensor, either orally or in writing that Licensee will cease to use these trademarks, service marks, copyrights and trade secrets of Licensor. e. To terminate this Agreement as to any or all licenses. . RECEIVED @5/25/2018 18:44 May 25 10 10:41a ps f. To pursue any other remedy at law or in equity. Notwithstanding any said repossession or any other action which the Licensor may take, the Licensee shall be and remain liable for performance of all obligations on its part to be performed under this Agreement. All remedies are cumulative and may be exercised concurrently or separately. Licensee hereby waives any and all damages accasioned by the exercise by Licensor of any of Licensor’s rights or remedies upon the occurrence of an event of default under this section. Licensee agrees to indemnify Licensor for all costs and expenses, including reasonable attorneys’ fees, incurred by the Licensor in connection with the enforcement by it of any of its rights or remedies under the Agreement,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c044",
    "name": "Section 6.2 Choice of Law and Jurisdiction",
    "text": "2. This Agreement is made with reference to and shall be governed exclusively by the laws of the State of Minnesota, without reference to its conflicts of laws provisions. Venue for the enforcement of this Agreement shall be limited to the Hennepin County, Minnesota, Federal or State District Court to the exclusion of all other courts, but subject to appeal as provided for under Minnesota law and applicable rules of civil and appellate procedure. Licensee expressly waives any claim that this forum is inconvenient and stipulates to the Minnesota Court’s jurisdiction over its person."
  },
  {
    "id": "c045",
    "name": "Section 7. Integration, Amendment",
    "text": "SECTION 7~ INTEGRATION, AMENDMENT This Agreement and exhibits thereto, constitutes the entire agreement between the parties regarding the subject matter hereof. No term of this Agreement may be amended, modified, or waived by course of dealing or otherwise, except by written instrument signed by the parties hereto. The headings used in this Agreement are included for convenience only and shall not affect the construction or interpretation of this Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c046",
    "name": "Section 8. Notices",
    "text": "SECTION 8 ~ NOTICES All notices required to be provided under this Agreement shall be in writing and shall be sent facsimile transmission or overnight courier. All reports required to be made hereto shall be sent by facsimile transmission followed by first class mail."
  },
  {
    "id": "c047",
    "name": "Section 9.1 Disclaimer of Warranties",
    "text": "SECTION 9 — DISCLAIMERS AND LIMITS ON LIABILITY I. Without limitation to any other provision hereof, Licensor makes no warranties, express or implied, with respect to the properties herein licensed, including warranties of marketability, warranties of fitness for particular purpose, any warranties at common law, which warranties are hereby excluded and disclaimed by Licensor and waived by Licensee."
  },
  {
    "id": "c048",
    "name": "Section 9.2 Disclaimer of Representations",
    "text": "2, Licensor makes absolutely no representations regarding the suitability, character, effectiveness, legitimacy, legality, trust worthiness, non-infringing nature, or usefulness of the System(s) herein licensed and Licensee uses this License knowing no such representations of any nature regarding same have been made."
  },
  {
